---
![сведение рук в кроссовере лежа на наклонной скамье](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a48e84d-4839-4c30-a158-576570186a53)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Place an incline bench set to a 30–45 degree angle directly in the center of the cable crossover machine. Sit on the bench and grab the handles attached to the low pulleys one by one.

### Step 2
Squeeze your shoulder blades together and keep a natural arch in your lower back. Place your feet flat on the floor shoulder-width apart with your toes pointed slightly outward for stability.

### Step 3
Starting arm position: keep your upper arms parallel to the floor with a slight, fixed bend in your elbows. Rest your head firmly against the bench.

### Step 4
Exhale and bring your hands together in a wide arc over your upper chest. Hold for 1–2 seconds at the top, squeezing your chest muscles firmly.

### Step 5
Inhale and slowly open your arms back out to the sides to return to the starting position.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Lower your arms only until your elbows are roughly level with your shoulders, and bring them all the way together at the top to fully contract your upper chest.

• Keep your chest lifted and your shoulder blades squeezed tightly against the bench throughout the entire movement.
{{< /callout >}}
